    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62278" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λείρ-ιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Madonna lily, Lilium
